@startuml
title Activity 11 - Supplier Order Acknowledgement

|Supplier|
start
:Open supplier notification;
:Open Order Acknowledgement;
|Frontend|
:Load approved PO details;
:Show items, quantities and requested dates;
|Supplier|
:Confirm quantities and expected delivery;
:Choose Accept or Reject;
if (Reject?) then (yes)
  :Enter supplier rejection reason;
  |Backend|
  :Validate supplier owns PO;
  :Set acknowledgement = REJECTED;
  :Save reason and audit history;
  :Notify requester and manager;
  stop
else (Accept)
  |Frontend|
  :Validate acknowledgement fields;
  if (Fields valid?) then (yes)
    :POST supplier acknowledgement;
    |Backend|
    :Set acknowledgement = ACKNOWLEDGED;
    :Generate delivery record = PENDING_DELIVERY;
    :Notify requester;
    |Supplier|
    :See delivery task;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Show validation errors;
    stop
  endif
endif
@enduml
